locations.description:
**Requirements:** Obtained from the Seer in Resting Grounds after a dream challenge

**Effect:** Collects Soul and Essence; reads NPC thoughts; enters dreams for boss rematches, hidden areas; 

**Note:** Dream Nail can be [awakened ](https://mapgenie.io/hollow-knight/maps/hallownest?locationIds=469860) at 1800 Essence to pierce special barriers
